# What does not go into the image — it shrinks the build context and prevents leaking secrets.

.git/
.github/
node_modules/
vendor/
graphify-out/
STORE/

# ⚠️ .env never enters the image. The settings arrive through environment in
# docker-compose, and copying a development machine's secrets file into a publishable image
# is the most common way of leaking them.
.env

storage/backups/*
storage/*.log
coverage/
.phpunit.cache/
.lighthouseci/
tests/
*.md
!README.md
